+/*
+ * Linux's gmu->gpu_freqs for sdm845 (index 0 is "off") with the opp-level (RPMh
+ * VLVL) of each sdm845.dtsi GPU OPP; the GMU's own OPPs are 200 MHz MIN_SVS and
